      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Early families such as the McCoys, Jacksons, Douglasses, Colliers, and Brooks settled here, drawn by farming opportunities and nearby waterways that eased travel and trade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
