      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Before Anglo settlement, the region that is now Douglassville was inhabited for centuries by the Caddo Indians, an agricultural people who largely abandoned the area by the late 18th century.",
